  "，几千颗盘星当作只受这两个质点引力、彼此不互相吸引的「试验粒子」。当时的计算机跑不了真正的 N 体，但这台简化机器一次就复现了天文照片上那些桥与潮尾——潮汐尾的形状，几乎只取决于交会的几何。这个世界跑的就是同一套算法。": ", and thousands of disk stars as non-interacting test particles that feel only those two point masses. Computers of the day could not run a true N-body, yet this reduced machine reproduced the bridges and tidal tails on plates—tail shape depends almost only on encounter geometry. This world runs that same algorithm.",
