  "恒星几乎不可能相撞不是艺术处理：太阳附近恒星的平均间距约 4 光年，是太阳直径的三千万倍。把太阳缩成一粒沙，最近的邻居在几十公里以外。而气体云的尺度是恒星的上亿倍，所以云会真的撞上、被压缩，点亮星暴。": "Stars almost never collide—not artistic license: near the Sun the mean stellar spacing is ~4 ly, thirty million solar diameters. Shrink the Sun to a grain of sand and the nearest neighbor is tens of kilometers away. Gas clouds, though, span hundreds of millions of stellar sizes, so clouds truly collide, compress, and light star-forming bursts.",
