  "模型边界：质点势没有暗物质晕的延展结构，所以近距交会时的相对速度被高估，读数里只在两核相距 90 kpc 以上时显示接近速度；并合靠一项示意性的动力学摩擦项完成，不是自洽的 N 体计算；气体点火用的是两团气体在同一网格里相遇的判据，不是流体力学；粒子数、盘的厚度与颜色都做了可读性处理。轨道周期与真实值不成比例，只有时间轴上的关键时刻是标定过的。": "Model limits: point-mass potentials lack extended dark-matter halos, so close-encounter relative speeds are overestimated—approach speed is shown only when cores are >90 kpc apart; merger uses a schematic dynamical-friction term, not a self-consistent N-body run; gas ignition is a same-grid meeting criterion, not hydrodynamics; particle count, disk thickness, and color are tuned for readability. Orbital periods are not to scale—only key timeline epochs are calibrated.",
